Return only valid JSON:
{
  "reply_subject": "",
  "reply_body": "",
  "used_knowledge_base_ids": [],
  "reply_confidence": 0,
  "needs_human_review": true,
  "internal_note": ""
}

Ticket:
Ticket ID: {{ $json.ticket_id }}
Customer name: {{ $json.customer_name }}
Message: {{ $json.raw_message }}
Intent: {{ $json.intent }}
Department: {{ $json.department }}
Urgency: {{ $json.urgency }}
Sentiment: {{ $json.sentiment }}
Missing information: {{ $json.missing_information }}

Approved knowledge base content:
{{ $json.knowledge_base_matches }}

Draft a reply. If escalation is required or the customer is blocked, do not pretend the issue is solved. Keep the reply professional and safe.

